{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0513_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "bb698433045c0bc3bf4f8fc7ddb3841692c637a7267509406b1afad1900c69f5", "ja": "聞こえてるやないですかっ！！\nあ～……う～……さすがに、これは……。", "zh": "这不是听得一清二楚嘛！！啊～……呜～……这下可真是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0513_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4aa569ef6a5d83bd0f577a61a23e70130e488da79b66a7a5840549d4c458eddb", "ja": "えっ！？　その、なんかごめん。盗み聞きしたわけ\nじゃないけど、似たようなものだよな……。", "zh": "诶！？那个，怎么说呢，抱歉。我也不是故意偷听的，但确实差不多就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0513_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "90c86c6972d2f1f400345d823fe7d00b42a15fe4a87905bfb596f6cf6bd2c87f", "ja": "いや、責めてるわけやないですよ？　大きい音にしてた\n私も悪いですし……。おあいこってことで！", "zh": "没啦，我并不是在怪你哦？放这么大声音的\n我自己也有不对……就算扯平啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0513_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f043e13761a9f95fd67a114632e089171b4506486388528b5fa99dc1269040d4", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n……それにしても、何を見てたんだ？", "zh": "啊，说得也是。\n……不过话说回来，你刚才在看什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
